WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.793
Deduplication has two separate problems First detect
which

00:00:05.819 --> 00:00:11.399
rows appear to represent the same entity Second
decide which row

00:00:11.425 --> 00:00:17.077
should survive or how the records should be merged
Do not jump directly from

00:00:17.103 --> 00:00:22.724
detection to deletion The duplicate key and survivor
rule both need

00:00:22.738 --> 00:00:23.659
to be explicit
